{"id":"a4359425e2c64d0a","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pda-final-state-semantics.md","title":"PDA Acceptance by Final State","display":"df-pda-final-state-language — PDA Acceptance by Final State","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics","aliases":["73-df-pda-final-state-semantics","73-df-pda-final-state-language"],"display":"df-pda-final-state-language — PDA Acceptance by Final State","depends_on":["[[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§6.1–6.3, print pp. 224–252; PDF pp. 246–274; local typed PDA interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§5.2, pp. 108–114; local finite-branch transition/configuration functions","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":6},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pda-final-state-semantics</span><span>73-df-pda-final-state-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pda-final-state-language — PDA Acceptance by Final State"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" href=\"?note=c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" title=\"73-df-pda-transition-semantics\">73-df-pda-transition-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§6.1–6.3, print pp. 224–252; PDF pp. 246–274; local typed PDA interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§5.2, pp. 108–114; local finite-branch transition/configuration functions"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (pushdown automaton)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_M^*\">\\(\\vdash_M^*\\)</span> (zero-or-more transition relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" href=\"?note=c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" title=\"73-df-pda-transition-semantics\">73-df-pda-transition-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}final\\text{-}state\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_F(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in F\\,\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\gamma))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}final\\text{-}state\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_F(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in F\\,\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\gamma))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Acceptance requires all input to be consumed and a final state to be reached; the residual stack is unrestricted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-transition-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-transition-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash_M^*$ (zero-or-more transition relation, see [[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_M^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}final\\text{-}state\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_F(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in F\\,\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\gamma))\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1573,"backlinks":[{"id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$。$M$ 是候选 PDA；结构判断后令 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)$ 为有效实例。PDA 有限转移集与终态语言见 [[73-df-pda-structure]]、[[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics|PDA Acceptance by Final State]]"},{"id":"7dd8ceb2520b13ca","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}$, $L_F$, and $L_{\\varnothing}$ (PDA acceptance modes, see [[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]] and [[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]])"},{"id":"33e207bac16abe1a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}$ and $L_F(M)$ (PDAs and final-state languages, see [[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]])"}],"outgoing":["c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8"]}